WEBVTT

00:00:02.899 --> 00:00:04.192
Johnny?!

00:00:04.275 --> 00:00:05.652
Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:00:05.735 --> 00:00:08.613
Your dad's a human now,
and Johnny's a monster.

00:00:08.697 --> 00:00:10.156
Oh, no.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.450
I was not supposed to say that out loud.

00:00:13.535 --> 00:00:15.328
(Johnny panting)

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:17.205
(grunts, sighs)

00:00:18.665 --> 00:00:21.334
(straining)

00:00:21.418 --> 00:00:22.794
Hey, thanks for the lift.

00:00:22.877 --> 00:00:24.170
(passengers gasp)

00:00:24.254 --> 00:00:25.797
(strains, chuckles)

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.632
(straining)

00:00:27.716 --> 00:00:29.759
-(cell phone ringing)
-Huh?

00:00:31.094 --> 00:00:32.971
-(gasps)
-(phone beeps)

00:00:33.054 --> 00:00:34.973
Johnny. Johnny, hurry up.

00:00:35.056 --> 00:00:37.058
-(straining)
-(people murmuring)

00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:39.853
Ah. (chuckles)

00:00:39.936 --> 00:00:41.563
Adios, everybody.

00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:42.647
DRACULA:
Come on!

00:00:42.731 --> 00:00:44.357
We don't have time for chitchat.

00:00:44.441 --> 00:00:47.610
We've got to get through this jungle
if we're going to find the crystal.

00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:49.821
(yelps, grunts)

00:00:49.904 --> 00:00:51.781
(pained grunting)

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.493
-(screaming)
-(birds squawking)

00:00:55.577 --> 00:00:57.412
(animals calling)

00:00:57.495 --> 00:01:00.957
(grunts)
Johnny, we are getting nowhere.

00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:03.043
(straining)

00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:05.920
Don't worry, Drac.

00:01:06.004 --> 00:01:07.130
I got you covered.

00:01:07.213 --> 00:01:09.257
Huh? (grunting)

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.137
And the final touch.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.057
Now you're ready for the great outdoors.

00:01:18.892 --> 00:01:20.268
Fine. Okay. Whatever.

00:01:20.351 --> 00:01:22.479
-Can we please just get going?
-Hold up, Drac.

00:01:22.562 --> 00:01:24.856
-Whoa!
-You forgot your trunk.

00:01:24.939 --> 00:01:27.859
Okay, let's find that crystal.

00:01:27.942 --> 00:01:29.861
(straining)

00:01:29.944 --> 00:01:32.655
♪ ♪

00:01:32.739 --> 00:01:35.867
Come on, Drac. You're gonna love hiking!

00:01:40.205 --> 00:01:42.040
(steady beeping)

00:01:42.123 --> 00:01:43.917
(grunting)

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:49.380
(whistling a tune)

00:01:50.465 --> 00:01:51.382
(shouts)

00:01:51.466 --> 00:01:53.093
-(Johnny sighs)
-(birds chirping)

00:01:53.176 --> 00:01:55.345
Aren't the sounds of nature soothing?

00:01:55.428 --> 00:01:57.263
(birds squawking)

00:01:57.347 --> 00:01:58.515
(groans)

00:01:58.598 --> 00:02:00.600
♪ ♪

00:02:01.726 --> 00:02:03.061
(sniffing)

00:02:03.144 --> 00:02:05.688
Ugh. What is that smell?

00:02:05.772 --> 00:02:06.773
(sniffs)

00:02:06.856 --> 00:02:08.817
Oh. What is that?

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:09.901
(sniffs)

00:02:09.984 --> 00:02:11.236
Oh! (gagging)

00:02:11.319 --> 00:02:12.987
It's me!

00:02:13.071 --> 00:02:15.323
Drac, chill. You just need a shower.

00:02:15.406 --> 00:02:18.701
And where am I going to find a shower
in the middle of the jungle?

00:02:18.785 --> 00:02:20.203
(thunder cracks)

00:02:21.746 --> 00:02:23.748
♪ ♪

00:02:28.253 --> 00:02:29.921
-(footstep squishes)
-Huh?

00:02:31.714 --> 00:02:33.925
(chuckles):
Whoa.

00:02:34.008 --> 00:02:35.218
(whoops)

00:02:38.429 --> 00:02:39.597
Hmm.

00:02:40.932 --> 00:02:41.933
(grunts)

00:02:42.934 --> 00:02:44.727
(Dracula sneezes)

00:02:45.728 --> 00:02:47.730
(snorting)

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.567
(sneezing)

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.861
Hey, I think you might have
a pollen allergy.

00:02:52.944 --> 00:02:54.529
Nonsense. I...

00:02:54.612 --> 00:02:56.531
(sneezing)

00:02:56.614 --> 00:02:59.826
(sneezing rapidly)

00:02:59.909 --> 00:03:02.120
(sneezes loudly)

00:03:02.203 --> 00:03:04.205
(groaning)

00:03:05.874 --> 00:03:08.334
(grunting)

00:03:08.418 --> 00:03:10.044
Johnny!

00:03:12.088 --> 00:03:14.090
(Johnny humming a tune)

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:18.970
(Dracula groaning, whimpering)

00:03:26.686 --> 00:03:28.688
(panting)

00:03:34.652 --> 00:03:36.487
(sizzling)

00:03:37.572 --> 00:03:40.950
How am I so wet

00:03:41.034 --> 00:03:44.287
and yet completely dry?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.372
(panting)

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.918
How much further?

00:03:51.794 --> 00:03:53.296
Huh?

00:03:53.379 --> 00:03:54.547
No, no, no.

00:03:54.631 --> 00:03:56.299
No, no, no, no, no!

00:03:56.382 --> 00:03:58.509
(sobbing loudly)

00:03:58.593 --> 00:04:01.721
We are never going to get there.

00:04:03.264 --> 00:04:05.850
(gasps) Whoa, Drac.

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:08.061
Isn't that something?

00:04:08.144 --> 00:04:10.355
Water. Thank you.

00:04:10.438 --> 00:04:12.023
I am melting.

00:04:12.106 --> 00:04:14.609
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold on, Drac.

00:04:14.692 --> 00:04:17.612
You got to be extra careful
with strange bodies of water.

00:04:17.695 --> 00:04:19.614
This one time, my friend Katmatchka and I

00:04:19.697 --> 00:04:21.908
were backpacking in Thailand...

00:04:21.991 --> 00:04:22.992
Drac?

00:04:23.076 --> 00:04:27.330
Wahoo...!

00:04:30.792 --> 00:04:33.795
(screaming)

00:04:39.342 --> 00:04:41.970
Well, look on the bright side.

00:04:42.053 --> 00:04:44.180
At least you're not hot anymore.

00:04:44.264 --> 00:04:46.557
-(groans)
-(phone ringing)

00:04:46.641 --> 00:04:48.268
(nervous grunting)

00:04:52.814 --> 00:04:54.524
(line beeping)

00:04:54.607 --> 00:04:56.276
Ugh, I can't get through to them.

00:04:56.359 --> 00:04:58.152
I'm not having any luck either.

00:04:58.236 --> 00:05:00.071
(sighs) I don't understand.

00:05:00.154 --> 00:05:02.031
What are they doing in South America?

00:05:02.115 --> 00:05:04.784
And how did they change themselves
in the first place?

00:05:04.867 --> 00:05:07.287
Exactly. It's not like
there's a mad scientist

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.747
just living in the basement.

00:05:09.831 --> 00:05:10.957
Oh.

00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:15.795
Great-Grandfather, what did you... do?

00:05:20.341 --> 00:05:21.592
Oh, no.

00:05:21.676 --> 00:05:23.803
(echoing):
Great-Grandfather?

00:05:25.346 --> 00:05:27.307
Oh. Hello, ladies.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.017
A little busy at the moment.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.102
What did you do to Johnny and my dad?!

00:05:31.185 --> 00:05:32.312
Shh.

00:05:32.395 --> 00:05:33.771
Lower your voice.

00:05:33.855 --> 00:05:35.773
(growling)

00:05:35.857 --> 00:05:36.899
-(roars)
-(both scream)

00:05:36.983 --> 00:05:39.819
-(gasps)
-Is that... Gigi?

00:05:39.902 --> 00:05:41.237
(roaring)

00:05:41.321 --> 00:05:45.283
Turns out the ray is highly unstable.

00:05:48.661 --> 00:05:50.496
(grunts, strains)

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.999
The transformation keeps mutating

00:05:53.082 --> 00:05:55.793
and won't stop until the subject becomes

00:05:55.877 --> 00:05:58.588
a mindless, ravenous beast!

00:05:58.671 --> 00:05:59.714
(grunts)

00:05:59.797 --> 00:06:01.132
Keeps mutating?

00:06:01.215 --> 00:06:03.009
Whoa! (grunts)

00:06:03.092 --> 00:06:04.635
Oh, no. Johnny!

00:06:04.719 --> 00:06:06.304
(shouts)

00:06:06.387 --> 00:06:08.389
♪ ♪

00:06:09.557 --> 00:06:10.725
(grunts)

00:06:10.808 --> 00:06:11.809
Ericka!

00:06:11.893 --> 00:06:14.270
Got it. (whistles)

00:06:14.354 --> 00:06:15.813
Hey! Gigi!

00:06:17.273 --> 00:06:18.524
Over here!

00:06:18.608 --> 00:06:19.859
(grunts)

00:06:23.154 --> 00:06:25.156
(Gigi squeaking)

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.659
We've got to find my dad and Johnny

00:06:28.743 --> 00:06:30.328
before it's too late!

00:06:31.412 --> 00:06:32.830
(roaring)

00:06:34.916 --> 00:06:37.335
(Johnny growling, snarling)

00:06:41.422 --> 00:06:42.673
(chuckles):
Ah, man.

00:06:42.757 --> 00:06:45.885
Why didn't anyone tell me
that claws are so awesome?

00:06:45.968 --> 00:06:48.554
(grunts, growls)

00:06:48.638 --> 00:06:49.847
(gasps)

00:06:52.183 --> 00:06:53.643
Whoa.

00:06:53.726 --> 00:06:56.354
Being a monster is super weird.

00:06:56.437 --> 00:06:58.481
(groans) Yeah.

00:06:58.564 --> 00:07:01.317
But being a human is the worst.

00:07:01.401 --> 00:07:03.778
Ah, come on. I wouldn't say that.

00:07:03.861 --> 00:07:05.154
Really?

00:07:05.238 --> 00:07:08.574
Blisters, sunburn and swamp butt
aren't the worst?

00:07:08.658 --> 00:07:10.243
-(mosquito buzzing)
-What was that?

00:07:10.326 --> 00:07:11.494
(grunts)

00:07:12.578 --> 00:07:13.871
Mosquito!

00:07:13.955 --> 00:07:15.248
Vampires of the jungle.

00:07:15.331 --> 00:07:16.999
Hey, I resent that.

00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:18.084
Yow!

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.628
(grunting)

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.215
They're everywhere! Yi!

00:07:24.298 --> 00:07:26.050
Johnny, they're all over you!

00:07:26.134 --> 00:07:27.635
What?

00:07:30.012 --> 00:07:31.556
Monster skin.

00:07:31.639 --> 00:07:32.932
Don't worry, Drac.

00:07:33.015 --> 00:07:34.434
They can't bite me.

00:07:36.394 --> 00:07:38.271
(shouting, grunting)

00:07:47.071 --> 00:07:49.740
-Wha...?
-Hold still, Drac! I got him!

00:07:49.824 --> 00:07:51.742
-Johnny, wait!
-(slap)

00:07:53.661 --> 00:07:55.663
♪ ♪

